   "ai_informationAboutTraining": "Built on Falcon-H1-7B-Base; trained via cold-start supervised fine-tuning with long reasoning traces, then further enhanced by scaling RL with GRPO.",
   "comment": "releaseTime: release date not stated in the card; Hugging Face repo creation time used.\naccess_conditions: false\nadditional_assets: Technical report (GitHub PDF and Hugging Face paper page) and a release/technical blogpost are linked; base model Falcon-H1-7B-Base is on Hugging Face; TTS evaluated via DeepConf (external GitHub code). Inference is supported via transformers, vLLM and SGLang.\narchitecture_details: Causal decoder-only model with a hybrid architecture (Transformers + Mamba2), built on Falcon-H1-7B-Base. The card does not state layers, attention type, experts, active parameters or rationale.\nintegration_means: Can be used via Hugging Face `transformers`, `vLLM` or `SGLang`; vLLM and SGLang servers are started with a reasoning parser and queried via an OpenAI-compatible client; the model generates think content wrapped in a `<think>...</think>` block followed by the final response; recommended temperature 0.6, top-p 0.95, max new tokens up to 65536.\neval_methodology: Test-time scaling (TTS) results on a few benchmarks were evaluated via DeepConf; AMO-Bench* is limited to the parser-verifiable subset of 39 problems. Recommended sampling: temperature 0.6, top-p 0.95, max new tokens up to 65536.\nbase_model_relation: finetune"
